{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_014_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:66fec0f76dc7413574aeed9e8f48245ec24ccf0d1c9c8f592f2e9d4ab4c73319",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71848eb07181ee9fa2efb87a921d84057e30f422a23bd8f034d558feef528f81",
      "text": "我来说明一下今天的拍摄流程。\n首先，拍摄前的最终确认在休息室进行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316bcb65e82f0a0b30e19708702f95fdaf7b626bbf7d2c3cb74b43d9b7c1a2e3",
      "text": "（台词确认没有问题。\n剩下的就是正式开拍时不要出错）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12e6e286122d7c0bc7ba66e8e813ed794fd71d5e2b5f6a257339d4301658de34",
      "text": "然后步骤确认完毕后就直接进入拍摄……\n那个，英雄先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7436ed1d3b2c3e4a222037989aab310257dce2057c65a37e6471e236f8e8564",
      "text": "嗯？啊！抱歉，我有在认真听。\n一想到必须好好表现，就不由自主走神了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78f7892ed79119fce5fe354775cf602e616e25b8716890fdbe6e2445f27d0afd",
      "text": "只要按平时的表现来就没问题的。\n放松心情加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccf82634965411cdaa73f140a2842ba4400eaea4866d2010895a0e0afedbf2bd",
      "text": "放松……是啊。\n谢谢你，制作人。包在我身上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15127ab8928e054baacff861102348bf08c5014a47f06d1e70941b7fcbee1f73",
      "text": "（说起来，今天早上龙和信玄发来的\n庆祝LINK里也给我加油打气了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1752249c425f9b1631335e3ae2cbe4a0f584bd9d9a45517de1e0ce57a11d0df9",
      "text": "祝您生日快乐！\n我们一边准备派对一边为您加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca6d2a2a6cd92367b4a8a71c87e159f9815bee6494c7eab17347332fc86f6f66",
      "text": "生日快乐。\n今天也像平时一样享受拍摄吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_02_1_2_014_02:1_2_014_02_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d42ff4afc5ca1e2c9d541b536962155d5f801132956ef46953f09f51e97c7d47",
      "text": "好，我的新一年又要开始了。\n打起精神来！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
